<!doctype html><html lang="en"><head><meta charset="utf-8"><meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width,initial-scale=1"><meta name="robots" content="noindex,nofollow"><title>Paper B · Listening review</title><base href="/api/v1/course-tests/chinese-2/b/file/"><link rel="stylesheet" href="paper.css"></head><body><main><header class="hero"><p class="eyebrow">HSKKit · Chinese 2 Course Review · Original Paper B</p><h1>Paper B · Listening review</h1><p>40 listening/reading questions + 4 writing/speaking tasks. Independent course-review draft.</p><p class="note">Printable materials and answer references. Open the workspace for section clocks and local recording. Writing and speaking need self-review or review by your own teacher.</p><nav class="links"><a href="index.html">Overview</a><a href="student.html">Learner paper</a><a href="teacher.html">Answers &amp; scripts</a><a href="listening.html">Listen to Paper B</a><a href="student.pdf">Learner PDF</a><a href="student-traditional.pdf">繁體 PDF</a><a href="teacher.pdf">Answer PDF</a></nav></header><section class="box"><h2>20-minute listening track</h2><audio controls preload="metadata" src="assets/audio/listening-full.mp3"></audio><p>Use with questions 1–20. Each of four groups takes 5 minutes. Sources play twice; silence is intentional answer time.</p><a href="assets/audio/listening-full.mp3" download>Download full MP3</a></section><div class="audio-list"><section class="box"><h2>L1 · 5:00</h2><audio controls preload="none" src="assets/audio/listening-group-1.mp3"></audio><p>Five questions; each source twice, with answer time.</p></section><section class="box"><h2>L2 · 5:00</h2><audio controls preload="none" src="assets/audio/listening-group-2.mp3"></audio><p>Five questions; each source twice, with answer time.</p></section><section class="box"><h2>L3 · 5:00</h2><audio controls preload="none" src="assets/audio/listening-group-3.mp3"></audio><p>Five questions; each source twice, with answer time.</p></section><section class="box"><h2>L4 · 5:00</h2><audio controls preload="none" src="assets/audio/listening-group-4.mp3"></audio><p>Five questions; each source twice, with answer time.</p></section></div><h2 class="sectiontitle">Question-by-question listening review</h2><p>Short single-play clips below omit the long answer silence. Open a transcript only when reviewing.</p><div class="audio-list"><section class="box" id="C2B-M01"><h3>Question 1 · Before the pet sitter arrives</h3><audio controls preload="none" src="assets/audio/c2b-m01.mp3"></audio><details><summary>Review transcript</summary><p class="cn">小何来帮我们照顾猫以前，家里要准备什么？</p><p class="cn">你把猫粮放在桌上，我去把备用钥匙交给小何，猫的水我已经换好了。</p><p class="cn">好，我现在准备猫粮。</p></details></section><section class="box" id="C2B-M02"><h3>Question 2 · An after-school demonstration</h3><audio controls preload="none" src="assets/audio/c2b-m02.mp3"></audio><details><summary>Review transcript</summary><p class="cn">今天下午的宠物照顾活动几点开始？</p><p class="cn">四点。三点半大家可以先看照片，四点老师教我们怎么给小狗梳毛，五点再提问题。</p><p class="cn">我四点前到。</p></details></section><section class="box" id="C2B-M03"><h3>Question 3 · Taking turns with the dog</h3><audio controls preload="none" src="assets/audio/c2b-m03.mp3"></audio><details><summary>Review transcript</summary><p class="cn">放学以后，我每次带小狗出去二十分钟。哥哥今天问我要不要走四十分钟，可是小狗走久了会累，我还是按平时的时间走。</p></details></section><section class="box" id="C2B-M04"><h3>Question 4 · Trying a sports class</h3><audio controls preload="none" src="assets/audio/c2b-m04.mp3"></audio><details><summary>Review transcript</summary><p class="cn">你想学打球还是游泳？</p><p class="cn">我想游泳，可是只有周三晚上有空。</p><p class="cn">游泳课周二晚上开，周三有篮球课。</p><p class="cn">那先试试篮球课吧。</p></details></section><section class="box" id="C2B-M05"><h3>Question 5 · Remembering water for practice</h3><audio controls preload="none" src="assets/audio/c2b-m05.mp3"></audio><details><summary>Review transcript</summary><p class="cn">上次打球，小丁忘了带水，打完以后一直说口渴。今天他还没出门，就先往书包里放了一大瓶水，旁边的球鞋倒是差点儿忘了。</p></details></section><section class="box" id="C2B-M06"><h3>Question 6 · A precise meeting place</h3><audio controls preload="none" src="assets/audio/c2b-m06.mp3"></audio><details><summary>Review transcript</summary><p class="cn">你到了运动中心就在游泳馆等我吧。</p><p class="cn">我不游泳，今天要上篮球课。我们在篮球馆门口见，别走到游泳馆去。</p><p class="cn">好，我去篮球馆。</p></details></section><section class="box" id="C2B-M07"><h3>Question 7 · Getting to the centre</h3><audio controls preload="none" src="assets/audio/c2b-m07.mp3"></audio><details><summary>Review transcript</summary><p class="cn">公交车还要等半个小时，你想怎么去运动中心？</p><p class="cn">我们的自行车都在这儿，骑车只要十分钟。</p><p class="cn">好，把球放进车篮，我们骑车去。</p></details></section><section class="box" id="C2B-M08"><h3>Question 8 · Entering the sports centre</h3><audio controls preload="none" src="assets/audio/c2b-m08.mp3"></audio><details><summary>Review transcript</summary><p class="cn">从西门进去以后，怎么到篮球馆？</p><p class="cn">先穿过小广场，看到食堂再向左。篮球馆在食堂后面，不在停车场旁边。</p><p class="cn">好，先过广场。</p></details></section><section class="box" id="C2B-M09"><h3>Question 9 · Carrying equipment on a bus</h3><audio controls preload="none" src="assets/audio/c2b-m09.mp3"></audio><details><summary>Review transcript</summary><p class="cn">六路车两点前到运动中心，不用换车。十路车也能两点前到，可是中间要换一次。</p><p class="cn">我带着两个球和一个大包，不想换车，坐六路吧。</p></details></section><section class="box" id="C2B-M10"><h3>Question 10 · A cooler time for training</h3><audio controls preload="none" src="assets/audio/c2b-m10.mp3"></audio><details><summary>Review transcript</summary><p class="cn">星期六下午三点太热，室外练球还照原计划吗？</p><p class="cn">老师说改到早上八点，地点不变，还是学校球场。</p><p class="cn">好，我把原来下午的提醒改掉。</p></details></section><section class="box" id="C2B-M11"><h3>Question 11 · Packing for a picnic</h3><audio controls preload="none" src="assets/audio/c2b-m11.mp3"></audio><details><summary>Review transcript</summary><p class="cn">野餐要带几盒果汁？</p><p class="cn">原来六个人，现在只有四个人去，一人一盒就够。</p><p class="cn">那我带四盒，面包另外买两袋。</p><p class="cn">好，别按原来的人数买。</p></details></section><section class="box" id="C2B-M12"><h3>Question 12 · A mat for the whole group</h3><audio controls preload="none" src="assets/audio/c2b-m12.mp3"></audio><details><summary>Review transcript</summary><p class="cn">你想买哪张野餐垫？小号轻一些。</p><p class="cn">我们四个人，小号只能坐两个人。我买能坐四个人的大号，蓝色和绿色都可以。</p><p class="cn">那拿这张绿色大号吧。</p></details></section><section class="box" id="C2B-M13"><h3>Question 13 · A student offer</h3><audio controls preload="none" src="assets/audio/c2b-m13.mp3"></audio><details><summary>Review transcript</summary><p class="cn">这袋面包原来六块，今天学生买只要四块。纸袋要另外一块。</p><p class="cn">我是学生，自己带了袋子，只买面包。</p><p class="cn">那收你四块。</p></details></section><section class="box" id="C2B-M14"><h3>Question 14 · A practical picnic bag</h3><audio controls preload="none" src="assets/audio/c2b-m14.mp3"></audio><details><summary>Review transcript</summary><p class="cn">野餐包要轻一点儿，还要能挡雨。甲包轻，可是怕水；乙包很重；丙包又轻又能挡雨。</p><p class="cn">我们要走很久，天气也可能下雨，就选丙包。</p></details></section><section class="box" id="C2B-M15"><h3>Question 15 · The pet sitter’s key</h3><audio controls preload="none" src="assets/audio/c2b-m15.mp3"></audio><details><summary>Review transcript</summary><p class="cn">小何六点来照顾猫，钥匙还在你那儿吗？</p><p class="cn">在，但我放学后要去打球，七点才到家。</p><p class="cn">那你先把钥匙给楼下王阿姨，小何来了找她拿。</p></details></section><section class="box" id="C2B-M16"><h3>Question 16 · Heat later in the day</h3><audio controls preload="none" src="assets/audio/c2b-m16.mp3"></audio><details><summary>Review transcript</summary><p class="cn">早上还比较凉快，只有二十四度。下午会升到三十五度，也没有风。傍晚才慢慢凉下来。今天想去买球鞋的话，最好别在下午最热的时候出门。</p></details></section><section class="box" id="C2B-M17"><h3>Question 17 · Why the start time changed</h3><audio controls preload="none" src="assets/audio/c2b-m17.mp3"></audio><details><summary>Review transcript</summary><p class="cn">今天的球赛为什么改到晚上七点？场地没空吗？</p><p class="cn">场地一直能用，是下午太阳太强，大家怕热。晚上凉快一点儿，打起来更舒服。</p><p class="cn">明白了。</p></details></section><section class="box" id="C2B-M18"><h3>Question 18 · A manageable practice session</h3><audio controls preload="none" src="assets/audio/c2b-m18.mp3"></audio><details><summary>Review transcript</summary><p class="cn">我今天想运动，但老师说每次别超过一个小时，也先别跑步。</p><p class="cn">那可以选五十分钟的投篮课。跑步课只有半小时，游泳课却要九十分钟。</p><p class="cn">好，我去投篮。</p></details></section><section class="box" id="C2B-M19"><h3>Question 19 · A festival visit in stages</h3><audio controls preload="none" src="assets/audio/c2b-m19.mp3"></audio><details><summary>Review transcript</summary><p class="cn">端午那天，我们先在河边看龙舟，回来以后听老师讲活动的故事。听完故事，大家才到教室学做香包。我做的香包送给了弟弟，他特别喜欢。</p></details></section><section class="box" id="C2B-M20"><h3>Question 20 · A growing sense of confidence</h3><audio controls preload="none" src="assets/audio/c2b-m20.mp3"></audio><details><summary>Review transcript</summary><p class="cn">端午活动刚开始，小方说自己手笨，做不好香包。老师陪着她做了一次。后来老师还没走过来，她已经自己做好第二个，又开始教旁边的小朋友了。</p></details></section></div><h2 class="sectiontitle">Speaking prompts · S1</h2><div class="audio-list"><section class="box"><h3>S1-1</h3><audio controls preload="none" src="assets/audio/s1-1.mp3"></audio><p>Two plays in this file; then allow 15 seconds to prepare and 25 seconds to respond.</p><details><summary>Review prompt transcript</summary><p class="cn">明天去运动中心，你还需要借什么东西吗？球、球拍，或者别的东西都可以说。</p></details></section><section class="box"><h3>S1-2</h3><audio controls preload="none" src="assets/audio/s1-2.mp3"></audio><p>Two plays in this file; then allow 15 seconds to prepare and 25 seconds to respond.</p><details><summary>Review prompt transcript</summary><p class="cn">你想参加羽毛球还是游泳？也可以提出另一个运动。</p></details></section><section class="box"><h3>S1-3</h3><audio controls preload="none" src="assets/audio/s1-3.mp3"></audio><p>Two plays in this file; then allow 15 seconds to prepare and 25 seconds to respond.</p><details><summary>Review prompt transcript</summary><p class="cn">为什么这个运动适合你？告诉我一个理由就可以。</p></details></section><section class="box"><h3>S1-4</h3><audio controls preload="none" src="assets/audio/s1-4.mp3"></audio><p>Two plays in this file; then allow 15 seconds to prepare and 25 seconds to respond.</p><details><summary>Review prompt transcript</summary><p class="cn">南门明天不开，我们改在东门见，你觉得怎么样？如果不方便，你有什么办法？</p></details></section></div></main></body></html>